    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have learned to target the delicate parts of your Droid opponents, taking advantage of their mechanical frailties.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> While wielding a weapon with which you are proficient, you gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a> enemies, or +4 if you are using a weapon that deals <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion_Damage\" title=\"Ion Damage\">Ion Damage</a>.</p>",
